10:T9d7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』虚伝 燃ゆる本能寺","description":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』シリーズの記念すべき第1作。西暦2205年、歴史改変を目論む「歴史修正主義者」の脅威に立ち向かうべく、審神者の手によって顕現した刀剣男士たち。ある日、織田信長の愛刀であり、森蘭丸へと授けられた短刀・不動行光が本丸に加わる。信長への強い誇りを隠さない不動は、同じく信長を元主とする宗三左文字、へし切長谷部、薬研藤四郎らと激しく衝突し、本丸の和を乱していく。近侍・山姥切国広が事態の収拾に奔走する中、下された次なる出陣先は天正十年——信長がその命を落とす「本能寺の変」。元主の最期を前に、刀剣男士たちは自らのアイデンティティと、守るべき歴史の狭間で過酷な葛藤を突きつけられる。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage","keywords":"殺陣厚め, セリフ重め, ゲーム原作, 和風モチーフ","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐々木 喜英","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sasaki-yoshihide"},{"@type":"Person","name":"輝馬","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/teruma"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北村 諒","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitamura-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"椎名 鯛造","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shiina-taizo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"廣瀬 大介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hirose-daisuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"杉江 大志","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sugie-taishi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"東 啓介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/higashi-keisuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 拡樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"納谷 健","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/naya-takeru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"染谷 俊之","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/someya-toshiyuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"丸目 聖人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/marume-kiyohito"},{"@type":"Person","name":"窪寺 昭","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kubodera-akira"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{